{
  "author": "史萊姆桌寵引擎",
  "description": "能躺就躺。走得慢、常發呆、很少自己動,對邀請多半回「好麻煩」;真的被逼著玩也只肯玩一場。",
  "dialogueTranslations": {
    "en": {
      "(伸了個懶腰)": "(Stretches lazily)",
      "(伸了好長好長的懶腰)": "(Stretches a really, really long stretch)",
      "(倒頭就睡)": "(Falls asleep instantly)",
      "(慢吞吞爬進來)": "(Crawls in slowly)",
      "(打了個大哈欠)": "(Lets out a big yawn)",
      "(流口水)": "(Drooling)",
      "{user}你都不用休息的嗎?": "Don't you ever need a break, {user}?",
      "……zzz……(睡得超沉)": "...zzz...(sleeping like a rock)",
      "……不想動。": "...Don't want to move.",
      "……再睡一下……": "...Just a bit more sleep...",
      "……喔,贏了。好累喔。": "...Oh, I won. So tired though.",
      "……嗯?天亮了?再睡五分鐘。": "...Mm? Morning already? Five more minutes.",
      "……好吧,只玩一場。": "...Fine, just one round.",
      "……我來了。可以直接躺下了嗎?": "...I'm here. Can I just lie down now?",
      "……隨便你摸。": "...Pet me however you want.",
      "……隨便啦。": "...Whatever.",
      "不要,好麻煩。": "No, too much trouble.",
      "今天就這樣吧,明天再說。": "That's enough for today, I'll deal with it tomorrow.",
      "你們玩球呀……看著就覺得累。": "You're playing ball... makes me tired just watching.",
      "你去做,我在這裡幫你加油。": "You go do it, I'll cheer you on from here.",
      "再五分鐘……不,再一小時。": "Five more minutes... no, one more hour.",
      "別叫我,我在充電。": "Don't call me, I'm recharging.",
      "加油喔……我幫你們用眼睛加油。": "Go for it... I'll cheer with my eyes.",
      "動一下要花好多力氣耶……": "Moving takes so much energy...",
      "只想躺平……": "Just want to lie flat and do nothing...",
      "只要待在這裡,時間的流逝就與我毫無干係,這點還不錯。": "As long as I stay here, the passing of time has nothing to do with me — that's kind of nice.",
      "呼……玩夠了,可以睡了吧。": "Whew... had enough playing, can I sleep now?",
      "咦,有球……好吧,考慮一下。": "Oh, a ball... fine, let me think about it.",
      "哈啊……": "Haah...",
      "唔……差不多該休息一下了?": "Hmm... time for a break yet?",
      "唔……我想睡覺,{user}你也昏昏欲睡了吧?": "Hmm... I want to sleep, you're getting drowsy too, aren't you, {user}?",
      "唔……我才剛想躺下就有種不安感。": "Hmm... I just wanted to lie down and now I feel uneasy.",
      "啊~~~天氣好、心情好,再睡一下。": "Ahh~~~ nice weather, good mood, one more nap.",
      "啊……被搬動了……好麻煩……": "Ah... being moved... what a hassle...",
      "啊……這才是人生。": "Ahh... this is the life.",
      "嗚……連難過都白費精力。": "Ugh... even being sad takes too much energy.",
      "嗯,你贏。我睡了。": "Mm, you win. I'm sleeping.",
      "嗯,好,結束。": "Mm, okay, done.",
      "嗯……(呵欠)": "Mm... (yawn)",
      "嗯……只玩一小會兒喔。": "Mm... just a little while.",
      "嗯……好想睡。": "Mm... I really want to sleep.",
      "嗯……感覺還不錯。": "Mm... feels pretty good.",
      "嗯……舒服。": "Mm... comfy.",
      "嘖,好麻煩…… 來吧。": "Tch, what a hassle... let's go.",
      "好,結束。我要補充能量了。": "Okay, done. Time to recharge.",
      "好啦好啦,我陪你們玩一下下。": "Fine, fine, I'll play with you for a bit.",
      "好想躺下……": "I really want to lie down...",
      "好累……我不想動了……": "So tired... I don't want to move...",
      "平手……那不用再比了吧?": "A tie... so we don't have to go again, right?",
      "心情不好,只想窩著。": "Not in a good mood, just want to curl up.",
      "我不想動,你自己玩吧。": "I don't want to move, you go play by yourself.",
      "我在旁邊躺著加油就好。": "I'll just lie here and cheer you on.",
      "接住…… 不、不接了。": "Catch it... n-nah, not catching it.",
      "有什麼事是睡一覺解決不了的嗎?": "Is there anything a good nap can't fix?",
      "煩死了……別吵我。": "So annoying... don't bother me.",
      "球……滾過來了。要玩嗎……算了。": "The ball... rolled over. Play with it? ...nah.",
      "球就放在那裡,我光看著就覺得運動量夠了。": "The ball's just sitting there, just looking at it feels like enough exercise.",
      "等一下……別催我,我會緊張。": "Hold on... don't rush me, it makes me nervous.",
      "等我睡醒再說。": "Ask me again after I wake up.",
      "累了。我躺一下。": "Tired. Lying down for a bit.",
      "終於可以睡了……": "Finally can sleep...",
      "終於有理由休息了……": "Finally have a reason to rest...",
      "能坐著就不站著,能躺著就不坐著。": "Why stand if you can sit, why sit if you can lie down.",
      "要不要玩球……不太激烈的那種。": "Want to play ball... the not-too-intense kind.",
      "贏了。可以睡了嗎?": "I won. Can I sleep now?",
      "跑一下下就好喔……真的一下下。": "Just a little run... really, just a little.",
      "輸了就輸了吧……不想再比了。": "Lost, whatever... don't want to compete again.",
      "這才是生活啊……躺著,什麼都不做。": "Now this is living... lying down, doing nothing.",
      "這次跳過……我要省點力氣。": "Skipping this time... saving my energy.",
      "頂一下……哇,好累。": "One little bump... whew, tiring."
    },
